{"page":46,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:270","surah":2,"ayah":270,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَآ أَنفَقْتُم مِّن نَّفَقَةٍ أَوْ نَذَرْتُم مِّن نَّذْرٍ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَعْلَمُهُۥ ۗ وَمَا لِلظَّـٰلِمِينَ مِنْ أَنصَارٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whatever you may give, or vow to give, God knows it well, and those who do wrong will have no one to help them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنفَقْتُم","en_gloss":"you spend","transliteration":"anfaqtum","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"(out) of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَّفَقَةٍ","en_gloss":"(your) expenditures","transliteration":"nafaqatin","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَذَرْتُم","en_gloss":"you vow","transliteration":"nadhartum","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نَّذْرٍۢ","en_gloss":"vow(s)","transliteration":"nadhrin","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"fa-inna","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَعْلَمُهُۥ ۗ","en_gloss":"knows it","transliteration":"yaʿlamuhu","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"for the wrongdoers","transliteration":"lilẓẓālimīna","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَنصَارٍ","en_gloss":"helpers","transliteration":"anṣārin","verse_key":"2:270"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٢٧٠","en_gloss":"(270)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:270"}]},{"verse_key":"2:271","surah":2,"ayah":271,"ar_uthmani":"إِن تُبْدُوا۟ ٱلصَّدَقَـٰتِ فَنِعِمَّا هِىَ ۖ وَإِن تُخْفُوهَا وَتُؤْتُوهَا ٱلْفُقَرَآءَ فَهُوَ خَيْرٌ لَّكُمْ ۚ وَيُكَفِّرُ عَنكُم مِّن سَيِّـَٔاتِكُمْ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ خَبِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you give charity openly, it is good, but if you keep it secret and give to the needy in private, that is better for you, and it will atone for some of your bad deeds: God is well aware of all that you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُبْدُوا۟","en_gloss":"you disclose","transliteration":"tub'dū","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلصَّدَقَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the charities","transliteration":"l-ṣadaqāti","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَنِعِمَّا","en_gloss":"then good","transliteration":"faniʿimmā","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":5,"ar":"هِىَ ۖ","en_gloss":"it (is)","transliteration":"hiya","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تُخْفُوهَا","en_gloss":"you keep it secret","transliteration":"tukh'fūhā","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَتُؤْتُوهَا","en_gloss":"and give it","transliteration":"watu'tūhā","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْفُقَرَآءَ","en_gloss":"(to) the poor","transliteration":"l-fuqarāa","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَهُوَ","en_gloss":"then it","transliteration":"fahuwa","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":11,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) better","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَّكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَيُكَفِّرُ","en_gloss":"And He will remove","transliteration":"wayukaffiru","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَنكُم","en_gloss":"from you","transliteration":"ʿankum","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"[of]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":16,"ar":"سَيِّـَٔاتِكُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"your evil deeds","transliteration":"sayyiātikum","verse_key":"2:271"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And A