ءَ مِنَ ٱلتَّعَفُّفِ تَعْرِفُهُم بِسِيمَـٰهُمْ لَا يَسْـَٔلُونَ ٱلنَّاسَ إِلْحَافًا ۗ وَمَا تُنفِقُوا۟ مِنْ خَيْرٍ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ بِهِۦ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Give] to those needy who are wholly occupied in God’s way and cannot travel in the land [for trade]. The unknowing might think them rich because of their self-restraint, but you will recognize them by their characteristic of not begging persistently. God is well aware of any good you give.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لِلْفُقَرَآءِ","en_gloss":"For the poor","transliteration":"lil'fuqarāi","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أُحْصِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"are wrapped up","transliteration":"uḥ'ṣirū","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَسْتَطِيعُونَ","en_gloss":"they are able","transliteration":"yastaṭīʿūna","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ضَرْبًۭا","en_gloss":"(to) move about","transliteration":"ḍarban","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَحْسَبُهُمُ","en_gloss":"Think (about) them","transliteration":"yaḥsabuhumu","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْجَاهِلُ","en_gloss":"the ignorant one","transliteration":"l-jāhilu","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَغْنِيَآءَ","en_gloss":"(that they are) self-sufficient","transliteration":"aghniyāa","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"(because) of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:273"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلتَّع